{
  "id": "256",
  "title": "Guess the Riddle",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-02-25",
  "synopsis": "Can you guess this Chinese riddle?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/351/a86e5181263b5f94fe5835e1d9194443cc71bd18.mp3?1487706340",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "猜谜语\n\n    五个兄弟，住在一起，名字不同，高矮不齐。\n    这是一个谜语，你知道谜底吗？谜底是手指。谜语中把五根手指比作五个兄弟，五根手指分别是拇指、食指、中指、无名指和小指，所以他们的“名字不同”，再加上五根手指的长短不一样，所以就是“高矮不齐”。\n    你猜对了吗？",
    "traditional": "猜謎語\n\n    五個兄弟，住在一起，名字不同，高矮不齊。\n    這是一個謎語，你知道謎底嗎？謎底是手指。謎語中把五根手指比作五個兄弟，五根手指分別是拇指、食指、中指、無名指和小指，所以他們的“名字不同”，再加上五根手指的長短不一樣，所以就是“高矮不齊”。\n    你猜對了嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Guessing a Riddle"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "五个兄弟，住在一起，名字不同，高矮不齐。",
      "traditional": "五個兄弟，住在一起，名字不同，高矮不齊。",
      "pinyin": "wǔ ge xiōng dì zhù zài yì qǐ míng zi bù tóng gāo ǎi bù qí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Five brothers live together. Their names are different, and their heights are different."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "这是一个谜语，你知道谜底吗？",
      "traditional": "這是一個謎語，你知道謎底嗎？",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yí ge mí yǔ nǐ zhī dào mí dǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "谜底是手指。",
      "traditional": "謎底是手指。",
      "pinyin": "mí dǐ shì shǒu zhǐ",
      "english": "This is a riddle, do you know the answer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "谜语中把五根手指比作五个兄弟，",
      "traditional": "謎語中把五根手指比作五個兄弟，",
      "pinyin": "mí yǔ zhōng bǎ wǔ gēn shǒu zhǐ bǐ zuò wǔ ge xiōng dì",
      "english": "The answer is fingers."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "五根手指分别是拇指、食指、中指、无名指和小指，",
      "traditional": "五根手指分別是拇指、食指、中指、無名指和小指，",
      "pinyin": "wǔ gēn shǒu zhǐ fēn bié shì mǔ zhǐ shí zhǐ zhōng zhǐ wú míng zhǐ hé xiǎo zhǐ",
      "english": "The riddle likens the five fingers with five brothers."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "所以他们的“名字不同”，",
      "traditional": "所以他們的“名字不同”，",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ tā men de míng zi bù tóng",
      "english": "The names of the five fingers are thumb, index finger, middle finger, ring finger and little finger."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "再加上五根手指的长短不一样，所以就是“高矮不齐”。",
      "traditional": "再加上五根手指的長短不一樣，所以就是“高矮不齊”。",
      "pinyin": "zài jiā shàng wǔ gēn shǒu zhǐ de cháng duǎn bù yí yàng suǒ yǐ jiù shì gāo ǎi bù qí",
      "english": "Therefore their “names are different”."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "On top of that, the five fingers have different lengths, and thus their “heights are different”."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你猜对了吗？",
      "traditional": "你猜對了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ cāi duì le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Did you guess right?"
    }
  ],
