      "Guessing a Riddle",
      "",
      "Five brothers live together. Their names are different, and their heights are different.",
      "",
      "This is a riddle, do you know the answer?",
      "The answer is fingers.",
      "The riddle likens the five fingers with five brothers.",
      "The names of the five fingers are thumb, index finger, middle finger, ring finger and little finger.",
      "Therefore their “names are different”.",
      "On top of that, the five fingers have different lengths, and thus their “heights are different”.",
      "",
